<title>USA: Major states-U.S. all wheat intended plantings.</title>
<headline>Major states-U.S. all wheat intended plantings.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA 1997 all wheat planting intentions in major states in 1,000 acres, percent of 1997/96:</p>
<p>    -   PCT--IND'97--PLANT'96  PLANT'95</p>
<p> Colo   103   3,165   3,070	2,940</p>
<p> Kans    97  11,400  11,800     11,700</p>
<p> Mont    92   6,070   6,630	5,720</p>
<p> N.D.    82  10,340  12,680     11,290</p>
<p> Okla    97   6,800   7,000	6,900</p>
<p> S.D.    91   3,930   4,325	2,883</p>
<p> Texas  100   6,000   6,000	5,800</p>
<p> U.S.    91  69,187  75,639     69,132</p>
